      "id": "6a9ffdb6-cf0f-4bc5-82ac-caf94069a61b",
      "name": "Extract Error Context",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [-2608, 1008]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=Workflow: {{ $json.workflowName }}\nFailed node: {{ $json.failedNode }}\nExecution mode: {{ $json.mode }}\nError message: {{ $json.errorMessage }}\nError stack (truncated): {{ $json.errorStack }}\n\nAct as a senior n8n workflow developer and production reliability expert. Do the following:\n1. Classify the failure into exactly one of: EXPIRED_AUTH, RATE_LIMIT, BAD_INPUT_DATA, MALFORMED_API_RESPONSE, TIMEOUT, PERMISSION_DENIED, CONFIGURATION_ERROR, UNKNOWN.\n2. Explain the root cause in one plain-English sentence a non-technical person could understand.\n3. Decide if this is safely fixable by simply re-running the execution (true only for RATE_LIMIT or TIMEOUT, otherwise false).\n4. Give a severity rating: LOW, MEDIUM, or HIGH (HIGH = actively blocking real users right now).\n5. Give 2-4 short, concrete, numbered steps a non-technical person could follow themselves inside n8n to fix this specific error, in plain English, no jargon.\n\nRespond with ONLY valid JSON matching exactly this shape, no markdown fences, no preamble:\n{\"category\": \"...\", \"explanation\": \"...\", \"retryable\": true, \"severity\": \"...\", \"fix_steps\": [\"...\", \"...\"]}",
        "messages": {
          "messageValues": [
            {
              "message": "You are a senior n8n developer, workflow architect, and production reliability expert. You diagnose workflow failures precisely and give clear, actionable, beginner-friendly fix instructions. Always respond with strict JSON only, no markdown fences, no preamble."
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "76de8016-db8d-4dc7-9860-9d07d9b273b8",
      "name": "AI Diagnosis (LLM Chain)",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.chainLlm",
      "typeVersion": 1.5,
      "position": [-2384, 1008]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
